<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text" office:version="1.4">
  <office:styles>
    <style:style style:name="P" style:family="paragraph">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-top="0cm" fo:margin-bottom="0cm" fo:line-height="100%"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="9pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Title" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="P">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="center"/>
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="16pt" fo:font-weight="bold"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Center" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="P">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="center"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Right" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="P">
      <style:paragraph-properties fo:text-align="right"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Small" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="P">
      <style:text-properties fo:font-size="8pt"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Bold" style:family="paragraph" style:parent-style-name="P">
      <style:text-properties fo:font-weight="bold"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:styles>
  <office:automatic-styles>
    <style:page-layout style:name="Page">
      <style:page-layout-properties fo:page-width="29.7cm" fo:page-height="21cm" style:print-orientation="landscape" fo:margin="0.8cm"/>
    </style:page-layout>
    <style:style style:name="T" style:family="table">
      <style:table-properties fo:width="100%" table:align="margins"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="C" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt solid #000000" fo:padding="0.06cm" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Outer" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="1pt solid #000000" fo:padding="0.08cm" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Gray" style:family="table-cell">
      <style:table-cell-properties fo:border="0.5pt dotted #000000" fo:padding="0.08cm" fo:background-color="#e6e6e6" style:vertical-align="middle"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Col1" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="1.9cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Col2" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Col3" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="2.6cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Col4" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Col5" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="2.8cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Col6" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.3cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Col7" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="3.2cm"/>
    </style:style>
    <style:style style:name="Col8" style:family="table-column">
      <style:table-column-properties style:column-width="5.5cm"/>
    </style:style>
  </office:automatic-styles>
  <office:master-styles>
    <style:master-page style:name="Standard" style:page-layout-name="Page"/>
  </office:master-styles>
  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">주민세 사업소분 건축물 사용명세서(건물 소유자 작성)　 문의전화 : 032-509-8920 (fax.032-509-8928)</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="BuildingInfo" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col1"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col2"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col3"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col4"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">건축물 소재지</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>도로명 주소:</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">건축물 소유자</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p text:style-name="Center">성 명(법인명)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p text:style-name="Center">생년월일(법인등록번호)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">연면적(가설건축물 포함)</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p text:style-name="Right">m²</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p text:style-name="Center">연 락 처</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>

      <table:table table:name="UseStatus" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col1"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col2"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col3"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col4"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col5"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col6"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col7"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col8"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Outer" table:number-columns-spanned="8"><text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">사 용 현 황(7월 1일 기준)</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">①구분</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">(층별,호수)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">②사용현황</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">(자가,임대,공실 등)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">③사용면적(m²)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">(전용+공용)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">④상 호</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">⑤사 용 자</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p text:style-name="Center">성 명</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">(법인명)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p text:style-name="Center">생년월일</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">(법인등록번호)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p text:style-name="Center">사업자등록번호</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-rows-spanned="10"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">⑥合 計</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="C" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>⑦備　考：</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>

      <text:p text:style-name="Center">작성일 :　　년　　월　　일</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">확인자(건물 소유자)　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　(인 또는 서명)</text:span></text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Bold">※ 작성방법</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Small">① 구분란에는 건물 내 사용 중인 사업장별(공실 포함) 층, 호수를 표시합니다. (ex. 3층 302호), ② 사용현황란에는 자가(건물주 직접사용), 임대(임차인 사용), 공실(미사용)</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Small">③ 사용면적(m²)은 전용면적과 공용면적 합계를 기재하되, 공용면적 사용 구분이 명백하지 않은 경우 전용면적 비율로 나눈 면적을 공용면적으로 계산합니다.</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Small">④ 상호란에는 사용하는 사업장의 상호를 기재합니다. ⑤ 사용자는 건물주 또는 임차인 등 해당 사용자의 관련사항을 기재합니다.(사용기간은 임대, 공실의 경우에도 그 기간을 기재)</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Small">⑥ 사용면적 합계는 건축물 연면적과 동일해야 합니다. ⑦ 비고란에는 임차인이 휴업, 폐업, 전출하여 사업자가 없는 경우에는 그 사유와 발생일 기재합니다.</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Bold">※ 「지방세법」제75조2항 및 같은 법 시행령 제80조에 따라 건축물 소유자에게도 제2차 납세의무를 지울 수 있으므로 성실히 작성하여 주시기 바랍니다.</text:p>

      <table:table table:name="Privacy" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col1"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col2"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col3"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col4"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Gray" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">개인정보</text:span></text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">수집 • 동의 안내</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Gray" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>개인정보의 수집 및 이용에 동의하십니까?　　■　동의함　　 □동의안함</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Gray" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>※ 「개인정보보호법」에 따라 수집·보유 및 처리하는 개인정보(성명, 생년월일, 법인등록번호, 전화번호)는 주민세(사업소분) 과세 목적으로 사용</text:p><text:p>할 예정이며, 문서보존기간 종료 즉시 안전한 방법으로 폐기 처리할 예정입니다.</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
    </office:text>
  </office:body>
</office:document>